/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing extinction, nations and corporations form a temporary alliance to resist Gaia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades later, the player awakens as an experimental candidate for \u201cAnima,\u201d a pilot of the next-generation weapon system known as Gigas, and takes their first step into this age of chaos.</p>","developers":["AcrylByte","SEO INSEOK"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201070/d2c0fae3db99d685d1ae32d6e9dcf83f236ad014/header.jpg?t=1773474380","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) 2025 Acrylbyte. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3201070/643631608/3f3f10435c22ac97528c28c0f462454c503b170d/1754023202/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754026111","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3201070/643631608/3f3f10435c22ac97528c28c0f462454c503b170d/1754023202/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754026111","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3201070/643631608/3f3f10435c22ac97528c28c0f462454c503b170d/1754023202/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754026111","id":257176409,"name":"Early Access Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176409/ce5f858f824c88c1d0439d07fa1a2b9e85930caa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754026111"}],"name":"Gigantes Ex Machina","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Gigantes Ex Machina - $14.99 USD","packageid":1135158,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1499}],"title